>   lower compared to the old station (3600).
>   
>   Is this normal? Is there something to do about it or should I simply
>   live with it?

I got 10 responses all saying that the screen resolution on the
4/233's are selectable based upon some switches on the graphics
adapter. They are factory installed in super-vga (yeah!). Flipping all
the switches put me back in 1280x1024 mode.

