> 3 applications are executed. On DEC OSF/1 the user doesn't receive the mail.
> The mail is only delivered to the applications and there is no error neither
> warning.
> 
> So has somebody an idea on the reason why it works on Ultrix and not on OSF ?
> Or what is the exact format of the .forward file on OSF or how to manage
> to have the mail delivered to the user and to the apllications ?
