mirroring (we use LVM, without mirroring, and have had no problems).
The unlicensed features of LSM can do everything LVM can, except mirroring
(licensed in LSM, free but not working in LVM).
Thanks to all who responded, especially to allan@nabeth.cxo.dec.com who
tested what worked and what did not in LSM without the LSM license. Here is
the result of the tests (DEC OSF/1 3.2, using 'volassist')

Operation		without-license
---------------------------------------
dxlsm			failed
volprint		worked
create simple volume	worked
create large  volume	worked
create many   volumes	worked
create mirror volume	failed (available feature, but buggy, in LVM)
create stripe volume	failed

